@page "/help"

<PageTitle>Doopass — Help</PageTitle>

<div class="page-head">
    <div>
        <h1 class="page-title">Help</h1>
        <p class="page-sub">Shortcuts, security notes and about this project.</p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="help-grid">
    <div class="card">
        <h2 class="card-title">Terminal shortcuts</h2>
        <p class="card-sub">Keys available in the TUI application.</p>

        <div class="help-row"><span>Quit the app</span><span><span class="kbd">Q</span> <span class="kbd">Esc</span></span></div>
        <div class="help-row"><span>Open / close help</span><span><span class="kbd">H</span> <span class="kbd">F1</span></span></div>
        <div class="help-row"><span>Leave help screen</span><span><span class="kbd">Space</span></span></div>
        <div class="help-row"><span>Focus next element</span><span><span class="kbd">Tab</span> <span class="kbd">J</span> <span class="kbd">↓</span></span></div>
        <div class="help-row"><span>Focus previous element</span><span><span class="kbd">Shift</span>+<span class="kbd">Tab</span> <span class="kbd">K</span> <span class="kbd">↑</span></span></div>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
        <h2 class="card-title">Security</h2>
        <p class="card-sub">How your data is protected.</p>

        <p style="margin-top:0;">
            Your vault is encrypted with AES (Fernet) using a key derived from your master
            password with PBKDF2-HMAC-SHA256 (100,000 iterations).
        </p>
        <p class="muted">
            The store format is fully compatible with the original Doopass, so existing
            <span class="mono">store.enc</span> files open without migration.
        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
        <h2 class="card-title">About Doopass</h2>
        <p class="card-sub">Free and open-source.</p>

        <div class="help-row"><span>GitHub</span><a href="https://github.com/doopath/PasswordManager" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">doopath/PasswordManager</a></div>
        <div class="help-row"><span>Email</span><a href="mailto:doopath@gmail.com">doopath@gmail.com</a></div>
        <div class="help-row"><span>Telegram</span><a href="https://t.me/doopath" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">@("@doopath")</a></div>
    </div>
</div>
